    "summary": "Timing words in triggers:\n\n- **Start of Battle Round/Turn/Phase:** a rule that triggers then does so whenever any battle round, turn or phase starts.\n- **The Turn/the Phase:** a rule triggered during ‘the’ turn or phase, rather than your turn or phase or your opponent’s, triggers in both players’ turns or phases.",
